+// ---- process-local forwarder election ----------------------------------
+//
+// One client search reaches this process once per collection vchannel (the
+// proxy fans the same nq queries out to every channel leader). Each of those
+// delegator.Search calls used to issue its own P2P forward, so N worker QNs
+// ran the identical global search and the proxy merged N duplicated topk
+// lists. UB search ignores the channel, so exactly one channel per
+// collection may forward; the rest contribute no rows.
+//
