+// the proxy node id (constant for every search), which is also why the C++
+// side is entered with force_main=true and cannot use its own
+// `req_id % shard_count` gate here. The channel set of the process is
+// stable while the node holds the same vchannels, so electing the smallest
+// channel name per collection is deterministic and needs no coordination
+// between the N concurrent delegator.Search calls.
